STR_GRF_NAME				:German-ish Town Names {DISPVERSION}
STR_GRF_DESC				:{PUSH_COLOUR}{GOLD}German-ish Town Names{WHITE}{}... with fun. Thousands of possible names that could be German town names. Hopefully all nonsense and many of them funny. This NewGRF might allow you to go from Ganz am Anfang to Abseilen auf dem Acker via Bad Turn. At least some basic understanding of German helps enjoying it.{}{GREEN}Compatible with v{MIN_COMPAT_DISPVERSION}{}{YELLOW}{COPYRIGHT}{COPYRIGHT_YEARS} by MarlongGd{}{POP_COLOUR}Licence: {YELLOW}CC-BY-SA 4.0 International

